{"provider": "google-cloud-vision:document_text_detection", "full_text": "I further certify and attest that I have affixed hereto recent photographs of the\nexecutants to the protocol of the deed and that stamp duty to the value a sum of\nRupees One Hundred and Ninety One Thousand Seven Hundred and Eighty\n(Rs.191,780/=) was duly deposited in cash in the Bank of Ceylon Battaramulla branch\nin proof of which the original of such stamp duty paying in slip No. BC/SE/OP\nNo.296912 dated 18/07/2025 for Rs.191,780/= is affixed to the duplicate of this\ninstrument and, copies are affixed to the original and the protocol and the Original of\nthis instrument bears one stamp of Re.1/= and that the said stamp was supplied by\nme.\nAnd I have applied for the renewal of the license for the current year.\nDate of Attestation\n18th July 2025.\nWHICH I ATTEST\nNotary Public.\nW.W.ANURA\nRATNA\nDHANARAT\n*\nL.B (Sti\nAttorney-at-Law\n&\nNotary Public\nCOLOMBO\nCS CamScanner", "detected_languages": [{"code": "en", "confidence": 0.9587}, {"code": "pl", "confidence": 0.0109}, {"code": "ro", "confidence": 0.0072}, {"code": "id", "confidence": 0.007}], "words": [{"text": "I", "confidence": 0.9045, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.107683], [0.820009, 0.117362], [0.804617, 0.117362], [0.804617, 0.107683]]}, {"text": "further", "confidence": 0.9904, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.122807], [0.820009, 0.183908], [0.804617, 0.183908], [0.804617, 0.122807]]}, {"text": "certify", "confidence": 0.9903, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.191773], [0.820009, 0.246824], [0.804617, 0.246824], [0.804617, 0.191773]]}, {"text": "and", "confidence": 0.9882, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.255898], [0.820009, 0.286146], [0.804617, 0.286146], [0.804617, 0.255898]]}, {"text": "attest", "confidence": 0.9891, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.298246], [0.820009, 0.344223], [0.804617, 0.344223], [0.804617, 0.298246]]}, {"text": "that", "confidence": 0.9896, "polygon": [[0.820009, 0.352692], [0.820009, 0.38657], [0.804617, 0.38657], [0.804617, 0.3526